# The flag sets collect.sh measures and check.sh checks, one per line as
# NAME|DEFS:
#
#   NAME  the flag's name in the flags column, e.g. narrow-gf16
#   DEFS  the -D flags that turn it on, e.g. -DNARROW_GF16=1
#
# The first line, with no name and no DEFS, is stock. Lines starting with #
# are comments.
|
